Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We are clearing weeds from the vegetable garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The gardener left a hoe beside the kitchen door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that hoe out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We should keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I dropped my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone is almost dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a light upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,AB 123 CD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CLOSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you lock the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any water?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a bottle in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that hoe out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now talking about the woman at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bartender calls her a hoe because she flirts with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that hoe out of here.
